# List of field labels for the GridData group of the SubData_* sub-dumps
# (OPT__OUTPUT_SUBDIV_GRID = 1).  One label per non-comment line.  The input label is
# case-sensitive.  This file is REQUIRED when OPT__OUTPUT_SUBDIV_GRID is enabled.
#
# Supported labels:
#   HYDRO      : Dens, MomX, MomY, MomZ, Engy
#   ELBDM      : Dens, Real, Imag (ELBDM_WAVE) / Dens, Phase, Stub (ELBDM_HYBRID)
#   Passive    : any user-defined passive scalar (check Init_Field.cpp for labels)
#   Derived    : Pote, ParDens/TotalDens, CCMagX/Y/Z, Pres, Temp, Entr, Cs, DivVel, Mach,
#                DivMag, Lrtz, VelX/Y/Z, Enth, GrackleTemp, GrackleMu, GrackleTCool,
#                and any user-defined derived field (OPT__OUTPUT_USER_FIELD)
#
# Note:
# --> Sub-dump derived fields are controlled SOLELY by this list; the OPT__OUTPUT_* flags in
#     Input__Parameter apply to main dumps only.
#     Listing ParDens/TotalDens without OPT__OUTPUT_PAR_DENS (the flag selects the deposition
#     mode) or a user-defined derived field without OPT__OUTPUT_USER_FIELD is a fatal error.
# --> Selecting any of CCMagX/Y/Z (or VelX/Y/Z) keeps all three components.
# --> A missing Input__Sub_Grid is a fatal error when OPT__OUTPUT_SUBDIV_GRID is enabled.
# --> The output field label in the HDF5 sub-dumps matches the label exactly (no prefix added).
#
Dens
